#: ../../chapter2.rst:24
msgid "Two Deployment Scenarios"
msgstr "Twee Implementatiescenario's"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:25
msgid ""
"The services can be deployed in flexible combinations to meet different "
"needs. There are two primary ways to deploy |prodname|."
msgstr "De diensten kunnen in flexibele combinaties worden ingezet om aan verschillende behoeften te voldoen. Er zijn twee primaire manieren om |prodname| te implementeren."

